[h2]Latest update[/h2]
[b]1.0.7[/b]
[list]
[*]Competing Exchanges reworked: compete with any Exchange, a tug of war settled every 5 years, and five competitor actions.
[*]The top three Exchanges are World Centres. The Exchange score favors size less, so other great powers can compete.
[*]Three new charter paths: Futures Pit, Lender to Nations and Railway Mania. Every path has a drawback.
[*]New: Blue Chips and Company of the Year. Blue chips also add Capitalist investment pool contribution, cut loan interest and help you in contests.
[*]Finance tabs renamed Trading Floor, Speculation, Banking and Exchanges. Tooltips rewritten in vanilla's style.
[*]A rival Exchange named in 1.0.6 is now a competitor. See the change notes for the full list.
[/list]
